Feature: CartPricing

  As a shopper
  I want to see the total for my cart after a percentage discount
  So that I know how much I will be charged

  Rule: a line total is the unit price times the quantity

    Scenario: one line
      Given a cart holding "2" items priced "10.00"
      Then the cart total should be "20.00"

    Scenario: a larger quantity
      Given a cart holding "5" items priced "4.50"
      Then the cart total should be "22.50"

  Rule: a percentage discount comes off the total

    Scenario: a discount that divides cleanly
      Given a cart holding "4" items priced "25.00"
      When a discount of "10" percent is applied
      Then the cart total should be "90.00"

    Scenario: a discount that lands between cents
      Given a cart holding "1" items priced "9.99"
      When a discount of "15" percent is applied
      Then the cart total should be "8.49"
